        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe aebele Mose ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Konkomesha abena Israeli pakuti baleleta amafuta kuli iwe ayo bengulula ku miolifa ayalengama, pakuleka ulubuuto lwa fisaniko lutwalilile ukulayaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunse ya cisalu cakucinga ku Mbokoshi ya Cipangano mwi Tenti Lyakukumaninamo, Aroni akalamona ukuti ifisaniko fili nokutwalilila ukwaka ifyo fine pa cinso cakwa Yawe ukufuma icungulo mpakafye ulucelo. Ili lifunde lyamuyayaya ilili nokukonkwa umukakonkanina inkulo shenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifi fisaniko ifyaba pa cakutekapo ica golide wine wine pa cinso cakwa Yawe, fifwile ukusungwa bwino no kulayaka pe mukutwalilila.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
